# Ignore file for infra/docker/web.Dockerfile (build context = repository root).
# Allow-list approach: ignore everything, then re-include only what the web build needs.
# This keeps secrets (.env), the legacy clone, the API and the mobile app out of the build context.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!web/
!packages/

# Never send dependencies, build output or local configuration.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
